{
  "comment": "Shared by the Android JVM tests and the iOS XCTests (FailedLoadRule); both crossfade orchestrators follow the same rule. Chosen alignment (iOS crossfade's loadIndex): a track becomes the active one once it loaded, and only then is it reported (active-track change, deprecated track-changed event, lock screen); while it loads and after its load fails (a give-up at stallTimeoutMs or the total limit, or a player error) the previous track stays active (none when there was none) and the failed track is never reported as active. The next play loads the previous track again or, when there was none, retries the track that failed. Items are named. Events: 'load' the player moves to an item ('report': whether the move is reported at once: only the first item of a new queue, which a standard player selects when the queue is set, before any load); 'ready' the item is ready (playing or with media); 'fail' its load fails; 'play' the next play ('reload': the item it loads first, null: it plays the current one); 'command' another command (a seek, a stop) on the player's own track; 'reset' the queue replaced or cleared. After each step, 'active' is the track that loaded last and 'reported' the track the app was last told (null: none). 'report' on ready, fail and command is the change reported then, 'to' (null: no track) from 'from'; no 'report' key: none.",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "LOAD-01 a skip whose load fails is never reported; play reloads the previous track",
      "steps": [
        {
          "event": "load",
          "item": "A",
          "report": true,
          "active": null,
          "reported": "A"
        },
        {
          "event": "ready",
          "active": "A",
          "reported": "A"
        },
        {
          "event": "load",
          "item": "B",
          "report": false,
          "active": "A",
          "reported": "A"
        },
        {
          "event": "fail",
          "active": "A",
          "reported": "A"
        },
        {
          "event": "play",
          "reload": "A",
          "active": "A",
          "reported": "A"
        },
        {
          "event": "load",
          "item": "A",
          "report": false,
          "active": "A",
          "reported": "A"
        },
        {
          "event": "ready",
          "active": "A",
          "reported": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
